    <h2>Conclusion</h2>

    <p>
        Email newsletters provide a practical way to communicate
        regularly with subscribers and provide useful information.
    </p>

    <p>
        A successful newsletter should have a clear purpose, relevant
        content, an effective subject line, an easy-to-follow structure,
        and a clear call to action.
    </p>

    <p>
        By understanding your audience, using segmentation and
